Package: companyresearch
Title: Public Company Research in Depth
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joseph", "Bennett", , "jbennett@jbennettconsulting.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A research tool for studying one public company in depth. Given a
    ticker, it builds a long history of the company's fundamentals from SEC
    data, turns that history into financial health and valuation measures, and
    presents the result as a one-page tearsheet.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
